              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "I'm nuts too"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My clan ate these up without 1 single complaint (RARE). I boiled the garlic cloves (3) in the potato water and then just mashed them up (with the hand mixer) along with all of the other ingredients. I did add more milk (skim), butter &amp; white pepper. Thanks Lorna!"
          },
          {
