              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "11.6.21 Followed the recipe to the letter, with the exception of replacing the milk with FF half-and-half (that amount was spot on for 8 potatoes) and omitting sesame seeds (that just wasn’t going to work with the rest of my meal). One little change and that is peeling and quartering the two cloves of garlic and cooking with the potatoes. Although I did mash the garlic with the potatoes, its flavor was still subtle, and I would add at least one more garlic clove in the future. These potatoes were creamy with perfect consistency, and although an indulgence, I most definitely will make again (just not too often!).",
            "datePublished": "2021-11-06T18:17:02.637Z"
          },
          {
