            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dallas Morris"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this almost exactly as directed - I used heavy cream rather than whole milk because I had to use it before it expired - and came out delicious. The idea to boil the garlic with the potatoes worked really well and there were no chunks to bite into. I'll definitely make these again.",
